{"id":"le_gende","lemma":"légende","pos":"noun","rank":1944,"glosses":["legend (story of unknown origin describing plausible but extraordinary past events)","legend (key to the symbols and color codes on a map)","caption"],"ipa":"/le.ʒɑ̃d/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/78/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-l%C3%A9gende.wav/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lepticed7-l%C3%A9gende.wav.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"légendes"},"formAudio":{"légendes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/09/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-l%C3%A9gendes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Légende cette photo.","en":"Caption this photo.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1098014","words":[null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"photo"}]},{"text":"Mets une légende sur cette photo.","en":"Put a caption on this photo.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"photo"}]},{"text":"Tous les pays ont leurs légendes.","en":"Every nation has its own myths.","words":[{"g":"all"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"land"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null]},{"text":"C'est une légende urbaine.","en":"This is an urban legend.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"urban","l":"urbain"}]},{"text":"La légende veut que cette maison soit hantée.","en":"Legend has it that this house is haunted.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"house, home"},{"g":"let be"},{"g":"haunted","l":"hanté"}]}]}